<title>USA: BankAmerica to redeem 11.25 mln pfd shares.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica to redeem 11.25 mln pfd shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said Tuesday it will redeem all 11.25 million shares of its Series H nine percent cumulative preferred stock on January 15 at $25 a share, plus accrued and unpaid dividends.</p>
<p>The accrued and unpaid dividends amount to $0.28125 a share, and will be paid to shareholders when they submit their shares for redemption, the company said.</p>
</text>
